          "title": "Restore the tool checkout before installing and invoking it",
          "whyItBreaks": "Both base and head trees contain only this workflow and .needlefish/answers.json; they contain no package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml, node_modules, or src/cli.ts. Thus pnpm install cannot install the reviewer in the repository root, and the subsequent tsx src/cli.ts invocation has no entrypoint. Every review job will fail before producing a PR review."
        },
