          "severity": "P1",
          "category": "security",
          "file": ".github/workflows/review.yml",
          "lineStart": 43,
          "lineEnd": 59,
          "title": "Do not execute the PR's reviewer with a write token",
          "whyItBreaks": "The workflow checks out the PR head and executes its dependency graph and src/cli.ts while GH_TOKEN is supplied and the job has pull-requests: write and checks: write permissions. A same-repository PR can modify the reviewer to emit a passing result or use that token to alter PR/check state, defeating the independent-review boundary that the removed trusted checkout provided."
        }
      ],
