          "title": "Restore the trusted checkout before executing the reviewer",
          "whyItBreaks": "The workflow checks out the PR head at lines 43-47, installs its dependencies at line 51, and executes its src/cli.ts here while GH_TOKEN is available and pull-requests/checks write permissions are granted. An internal PR can therefore replace the CLI or package lifecycle scripts to execute arbitrary code on the self-hosted runner and use the write-scoped token. The removed separate checkout was the trust boundary preventing this."
